license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "For even n>=1024 and m=n^2, the specified restricted bamboo-tree weak-rank functional is positive on squares of actual X/Y/U polynomials of degree at most floor(n/(32 log_2 n)). Informal AI-reviewed mathematics; novelty and priority are unknown."
